            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.35

- The Running list holds still: sessions keep a fixed order, and nothing moves between sections while the pointer is over the list.
- Running sessions sit under their project, idle ones fold into one row, and working sessions always show the step they're on.
- Hovering a row no longer reflows it, memory shows only from 1 GB, and ↑ and ↓ work from the list itself.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
